Subject: [PATCH] feat(coach): opt-in agenda and Google Tasks in the coach
 context
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An AGENDA line with today's and tomorrow's calendar events and the Google
Tasks «Mi día» shows (due today or overdue, due tomorrow), so the coach can
plan training and meals around the day. Off by default behind its own switch
in the Coach settings, since titles then go to the AI provider; Tasks are
read from the cache or with a silent token only (8 s cap), never a consent
screen from the coach.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
